  "goodToKnow": "Das Lichtjahr is a light year, the distance light travels in a year, about 9.5 trillion kilometres; it's a unit of distance, not time. Proxima Centauri, the nearest star after the Sun, is about 4.2 Lichtjahre away. Figuratively, Lichtjahre entfernt sein means to be very far from something: Von Gleichberechtigung sind wir Lichtjahre entfernt. Plural: die Lichtjahre."
